 "teaches": [
  "One ChatThread call with avatars: true: name on the first message of a run of theirs, lead (a 32 dp Avatar) on the last, so the avatar sits beside the bottom of the run as in every messenger",
  "attachment is any node drawn in the bubble above the text (a file card here); react and reactCount put a pill under the bubble; status is the line under your bubble (Seen by ...)",
  "conversations adds the chat list at the start from 720 dp (the thread keeps the rest, centred at most 920 dp wide); a tap sets the exported chat variable for the app to serve that thread",
  "The thread is anchored to the bottom and scrolls back with a drag; the composer field and the send button send compose and send to the app, which owns the keyboard"
 ],
